{"seq":1,"slug":"perils-cause-loss-classification","title":"风险、近因与损失类型分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-cargo-insurance-claims/risk-loss-assessment/perils-cause-loss-classification","wordCount":2611,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"风险-近因与损失类型分类\">风险、近因与损失类型分类</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-peril-cause-与-loss-是三层不同的对象\">核心概念：peril、cause 与 loss 是三层不同的对象</h2><p>一票从胡志明市发往汉堡的咖啡豆，船在东非海域遇上大风浪，舱盖被浪打裂，海水灌入，三个集装箱的麻袋受潮发霉。检验报告写「水渍损失」，理赔台却要回答三层问题：<strong>发生了什么风险事件</strong>（浪击、海水入舱）、<strong>损失由哪个原因主导</strong>（风浪，还是麻袋的防潮包装不足）、<strong>损失在法律上算哪一类</strong>（单独海损、共同海损，还是推定全损）。这三层混在一句「货损了」里，是理赔系统最常出错的地方。</p>\n<p>保险精算与海商法用三个词区分这三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>风险（peril）</strong> — 可能造成损失的<strong>事件类型</strong>，如火灾、搁浅、偷窃、海水入舱。它是承保范围的最小单元，ICC 条款第 1 条逐项列的就是 peril。</li>\n<li><strong>近因（proximate cause）</strong> — 造成损失的<strong>主导且有效的原因</strong>。它不是时间上最近的原因，而是那个「若无它损失不会发生、且未被新原因切断」的原因，决定损失是否落入承保范围。</li>\n<li><strong>损失类型（loss type）</strong> — 损失的<strong>法律形态</strong>，决定赔多少、谁分摊。同样是 10 万美元的货损，按单独海损是保险人赔被保险人 10 万；按共同海损则全体受益方按获救价值比例分摊。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三层对象有固定映射方向，但<strong>不是一对一</strong>：一个 peril 可以导致多种 loss type，一种 loss type 也可以由多个 peril 叠加。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[风险事件 peril&lt;br/&gt;火灾/搁浅/偷窃/水进入] --&gt; B{近因判定&lt;br/&gt;proximate cause}&#10;    B --&gt;|承保危险主导| C[落入承保范围]&#10;    B --&gt;|除外原因切断| D[拒赔或部分拒赔]&#10;    C --&gt; E[损失类型 loss type]&#10;    E --&gt; F[实际全损 ATL]&#10;    E --&gt; G[推定全损 CTL]&#10;    E --&gt; H[部分损失]&#10;    H --&gt; I[单独海损 particular average]&#10;    H --&gt; J[共同海损 general average]&#10;    H --&gt; K[施救费用 sue and labour]\">graph TD\n    A[风险事件 peril&lt;br/&gt;火灾/搁浅/偷窃/水进入] --&gt; B{近因判定&lt;br/&gt;proximate cause}\n    B --&gt;|承保危险主导| C[落入承保范围]\n    B --&gt;|除外原因切断| D[拒赔或部分拒赔]\n    C --&gt; E[损失类型 loss type]\n    E --&gt; F[实际全损 ATL]\n    E --&gt; G[推定全损 CTL]\n    E --&gt; H[部分损失]\n    H --&gt; I[单独海损 particular average]\n    H --&gt; J[共同海损 general average]\n    H --&gt; K[施救费用 sue and labour]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>系统字段含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件层</td>\n<td>peril</td>\n<td>ICC 第 1 条列明 / 一切险除外清单</td>\n<td>承保与否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果层</td>\n<td>proximate cause</td>\n<td>近因原则 + 判例</td>\n<td>举证方向、责任归属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形态层</td>\n<td>loss type</td>\n<td>MIA 1906 / 海商法 / YAR</td>\n<td>赔多少、谁分摊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"近因原则-判责的那一根因果链\">近因原则：判责的那一根因果链</h2><p>英国《1906 年海上保险法》（Marine Insurance Act 1906, MIA 1906）<strong>第 55(1) 条</strong>写下了近因原则：保险人只对<strong>由承保危险作为近因造成的损失</strong>负责，不对非承保危险作为近因的损失负责。第 55(2) 条列举若干推定规则，例如「损失由延迟引起，即使延迟由承保危险造成也不赔」——这正是 ICC 第 4.5 条延迟除外条款的法源。</p>\n<p>关键在于<strong>近因不是时间最近的原因</strong>。经典判例结构是：船在暴风雨中受损（承保危险）→ 被迫进避难港修理 → 在避难港卸货时货物被码头工人偷走。偷窃在时间上最后，但法院往往认定暴风雨是近因，因为进港卸货是暴风雨直接、自然、未被切断的后果。判定标准是<strong>主导性</strong>与<strong>连续性</strong>，不是时序。</p>\n<p>多层损失叠加时有三种典型结构：**链式（sequential）**取主导那一环为近因；**并发（concurrent）**若可分离则按贡献比例，不可分离时多数法域倾向拒赔或依条款约定；**中断（interrupted）**由新介入的原因成为近因。</p>\n<p>《保险法》没有「近因」的明文条文，但<strong>近因原则是司法实践普遍适用的裁判规则</strong>：最高人民法院在多起保险纠纷中确立「损失由承保风险引起才赔，由除外风险引起不赔」的裁判逻辑，举证责任方向随险别相反——这与 <a href=\"../insurance-basics-cover/institute-cargo-clauses-abc\">ICC A/B/C 险别与责任范围</a> 分析的举证结构一致。ICC(A) 下由保险人证明近因落入除外；ICC(B)/(C) 下由被保险人证明近因属列明风险。并发且不可分离时按贡献比例分摊：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>赔付</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{赔付} = L \\times \\dfrac{w_{covered}}{w_{covered} + w_{excluded}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">赔付</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 为各原因对损失的贡献权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为总损失；单一近因是分母只剩一项的极端情形，赔付为全额或零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"损失类型分类-atl-ctl-部分损失\">损失类型分类：ATL / CTL / 部分损失</h2><p>海商法把损失分成两大族：<strong>全损（total loss）<strong>与</strong>部分损失（partial loss）</strong>。全损又分实际全损与推定全损，两者的分界不是「货没了」而是「恢复货物的经济性」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>损失类型</th>\n<th>判定标准</th>\n<th>法源</th>\n<th>赔付后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实际全损 ATL</td>\n<td>标的灭失、失去原有价值、永久不可恢复</td>\n<td>MIA 1906 s.57；海商法第 246 条</td>\n<td>按保额全赔，无需委付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推定全损 CTL</td>\n<td>修复/施救/续运费用超过保险价值</td>\n<td>MIA 1906 s.60；海商法第 246 条</td>\n<td>须发委付通知方可全赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单独海损</td>\n<td>非共同海损的一般部分损失</td>\n<td>MIA 1906 s.64；ICC 各险别</td>\n<td>按险别赔，扣免赔额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共同海损</td>\n<td>为共同安全有意合理牺牲的费用</td>\n<td>海商法第 193 条；YAR 2016</td>\n<td>全体受益方按比例分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单独费用</td>\n<td>防止或减轻损失的必要费用</td>\n<td>MIA 1906 s.64(1)；ICC 第 16 条</td>\n<td>单独赔付，不占保额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推定全损的量化判据</strong>是理赔系统的核心算法之一。以中国《海商法》第 246 条为例，货物推定全损的成立条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>推定全损</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{salvage} + C_{forward} &gt; V_{insured} \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad \\text{推定全损}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">推定全损</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{salvage}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是施救与修复费用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{forward}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是继续运抵目的地的费用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{insured}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是保险价值。船舶的判据只看修复费用是否超过保险价值。达到阈值后，被保险人还须发出<strong>委付通知（notice of abandonment）</strong>（MIA 1906 s.62–63），声明将货物残余权利转移给保险人、请求按全损赔付，且须在知道损失后合理时间内发出——这是理赔系统里的一个<strong>硬性计时器</strong>，超时可能丧失按全损索赔的权利。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[货损事件发生] --&gt; B{货物是否仍在&lt;br/&gt;且可恢复}&#10;    B --&gt;|灭失或永久失去价值| C[实际全损 ATL]&#10;    B --&gt;|存在但恢复不经济| D{修复+续运费用&lt;br/&gt;是否超过保险价值}&#10;    D --&gt;|超过| E[推定全损 CTL]&#10;    D --&gt;|未超过| F[部分损失]&#10;    E --&gt; G[发委付通知按全损赔]&#10;    F --&gt; H{是否为共同安全有意造成}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[共同海损分摊]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[单独海损按险别赔]\">graph TD\n    A[货损事件发生] --&gt; B{货物是否仍在&lt;br/&gt;且可恢复}\n    B --&gt;|灭失或永久失去价值| C[实际全损 ATL]\n    B --&gt;|存在但恢复不经济| D{修复+续运费用&lt;br/&gt;是否超过保险价值}\n    D --&gt;|超过| E[推定全损 CTL]\n    D --&gt;|未超过| F[部分损失]\n    E --&gt; G[发委付通知按全损赔]\n    F --&gt; H{是否为共同安全有意造成}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[共同海损分摊]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[单独海损按险别赔]</pre><h2 id=\"共同海损与单独海损-谁分摊-谁自担\">共同海损与单独海损：谁分摊、谁自担</h2><p>两类部分损失的分野在<strong>是否为了共同安全而有意牺牲</strong>。中国《海商法》第 193 条的定义是：在同一海上航程中，船舶、货物和其他财产遭遇共同危险，为了共同安全，<strong>有意地、合理地</strong>采取措施所直接造成的特殊牺牲、支付的特殊费用，为共同海损。</p>\n<p>要素有三个，缺一不成：<strong>共同危险真实存在</strong>、<strong>措施有意且合理</strong>、<strong>牺牲或费用是措施的直接后果</strong>。典型场景是船舶搁浅后为脱浅抛弃部分货物（jettison），被抛弃货物的货主可从全体受益方按<strong>获救价值比例</strong>获得分摊；单独海损则由受损方自担，无分摊机制。</p>\n<p>共同海损理算依 <strong>《约克-安特卫普规则》（York-Antwerp Rules, YAR）2016 年版</strong>（国际海事委员会 CMI 2016 年纽约大会通过，取代 2004 版）；中国另有贸促会《北京理算规则》。分摊比例为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>分摊额</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{分摊额}_i = V_i^{saved} \\times \\frac{GA_{total}}{\\sum_j V_j^{saved}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分摊额</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5171em;vertical-align:-1.1567em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1567em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i^{saved}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1078em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 方获救财产价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GA_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是共同海损牺牲与费用总额。这在系统里就是一张分摊表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>共同海损 general average</th>\n<th>单独海损 particular average</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否分摊</td>\n<td>全体受益方按获救价值分摊</td>\n<td>由受损方自担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否故意</td>\n<td>有意采取的合理措施</td>\n<td>意外事故造成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否惠及全体</td>\n<td>为共同安全</td>\n<td>只涉及单方货物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法源</td>\n<td>海商法第 193 条 / YAR 2016</td>\n<td>MIA 1906 s.64 / ICC 各险别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统字段</td>\n<td>分摊价值、分摊率、理算书编号</td>\n<td>损失金额、免赔额、赔付比例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"施救费用与救助报酬-两个常被混淆的补偿通道\">施救费用与救助报酬：两个常被混淆的补偿通道</h2><p>理赔台最容易混的两笔钱是<strong>施救费用（sue and labour charges）<strong>与</strong>救助报酬（salvage charges）</strong>。中国《海商法》第 240 条规定，被保险人为防止或减少可赔损失而支出的必要合理费用由保险人赔偿；ICC 条款<strong>第 16 条「被保险人的义务」<strong>同样要求被保险人采取合理措施减轻损失。关键点是施救费用</strong>在保额之外</strong>另行赔付、不占保额，立法目的是鼓励积极施救。救助报酬则是<strong>第三方救助人</strong>施救成功后向获救财产方主张的报酬（通常体现「无效果无报酬」原则），赔付通道是<strong>计入共同海损或单独海损</strong>。MIA 1906 分别在第 65 条与第 78 条规定两者。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>施救费用 sue and labour</th>\n<th>救助报酬 salvage charges</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>谁支出</td>\n<td>被保险人及其代理人</td>\n<td>第三方救助人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发条件</td>\n<td>有损失风险即可，不要求成功</td>\n<td>通常要求救助有效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赔付通道</td>\n<td>保额之外单独赔付</td>\n<td>计入损失/共同海损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法源</td>\n<td>海商法第 240 条；ICC 第 16 条；MIA s.78</td>\n<td>MIA s.65；LOF 合同；海商法救助章</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把三层对象建进定损系统\">把三层对象建进定损系统</h2><p>把 peril / proximate cause / loss type 三层拆开建模，定损工作流才能被规则引擎驱动而不是靠人工判断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[报案:附检验报告与证据] --&gt; B[事件层:记 peril 清单]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按险别定承保方向&lt;br/&gt;A 由保险人举证,B/C 由被保险人举证]&#10;    C --&gt; D[因果层:近因判定&lt;br/&gt;链式/并发/中断]&#10;    D --&gt;|近因落除外| E[拒赔,出具除外条款依据]&#10;    D --&gt;|近因落承保| F[形态层:损失类型判定]&#10;    F --&gt; G{全损还是部分损}&#10;    G --&gt;|ATL| H[按保额全赔]&#10;    G --&gt;|CTL| I[触发委付通知计时器]&#10;    G --&gt;|部分损| J[判共同海损 / 单独海损 / 施救费用]&#10;    J --&gt; K[共同海损出分摊表]&#10;    J --&gt; L[单独海损扣免赔按比例]&#10;    H --&gt; M[输出定损单]&#10;    I --&gt; M&#10;    K --&gt; M&#10;    L --&gt; M\">graph TD\n    A[报案:附检验报告与证据] --&gt; B[事件层:记 peril 清单]\n    B --&gt; C[按险别定承保方向&lt;br/&gt;A 由保险人举证,B/C 由被保险人举证]\n    C --&gt; D[因果层:近因判定&lt;br/&gt;链式/并发/中断]\n    D --&gt;|近因落除外| E[拒赔,出具除外条款依据]\n    D --&gt;|近因落承保| F[形态层:损失类型判定]\n    F --&gt; G{全损还是部分损}\n    G --&gt;|ATL| H[按保额全赔]\n    G --&gt;|CTL| I[触发委付通知计时器]\n    G --&gt;|部分损| J[判共同海损 / 单独海损 / 施救费用]\n    J --&gt; K[共同海损出分摊表]\n    J --&gt; L[单独海损扣免赔按比例]\n    H --&gt; M[输出定损单]\n    I --&gt; M\n    K --&gt; M\n    L --&gt; M</pre><p>落地时最少需要三组字段：<strong>事件层</strong> <code>perils[]</code>（取自 ICC 第 1 条清单与除外清单）与 <code>evidence_refs[]</code>；<strong>因果层</strong> <code>proximate_cause</code>、<code>causation_pattern</code>（chain / concurrent / interrupted）、<code>burden_of_proof_owner</code>（由险别自动推导）、<code>excluded_clause_ref</code>；<strong>形态层</strong> <code>loss_type</code>（ATL / CTL / general_average / particular_average / sue_and_labour / salvage）、<code>deductible</code>、<code>salvage_value</code>、<code>contribution_share</code>、<code>abandonment_notice_deadline</code>（仅 CTL）。其价值在于<strong>可核验</strong>：每条拒绝或赔付都能回溯到具体条款号（如「拒赔依据：ICC 第 4.4 条货物固有缺陷」）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三层对象不可混同</strong>：peril 是事件类型，proximate cause 是主导原因，loss type 是法律形态；三者多对多，须分层建模。</li>\n<li><strong>近因不是时间最近的原因</strong>，而是主导且未被切断的原因；MIA 1906 第 55 条为其法源。</li>\n<li><strong>举证方向由险别决定</strong>：ICC(A) 下保险人证除外，ICC(B)/(C) 下被保险人证列明险。</li>\n<li><strong>全损与部分损的分界是经济性</strong>：推定全损判据是修复与续运费用之和超过保险价值，且须发委付通知。</li>\n<li><strong>共同海损分摊、单独海损自担</strong>：前者依海商法第 193 条与 YAR 2016 按获救价值分摊。</li>\n<li><strong>施救费用在保额之外单独赔付</strong>，救助报酬计入损失；混淆会导致重复赔付或漏赔。</li>\n<li>定损系统最小字段集 = peril 清单 + 近因与举证方 + 损失类型与分摊参数；结论须能回指条款号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"风险、近因与损失类型分类","id":"风险-近因与损失类型分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：peril、cause 与 loss 是三层不同的对象","id":"核心概念-peril-cause-与-loss-是三层不同的对象"},{"level":2,"text":"近因原则：判责的那一根因果链","id":"近因原则-判责的那一根因果链"},{"level":2,"text":"损失类型分类：ATL / CTL / 部分损失","id":"损失类型分类-atl-ctl-部分损失"},{"level":2,"text":"共同海损与单独海损：谁分摊、谁自担","id":"共同海损与单独海损-谁分摊-谁自担"},{"level":2,"text":"施救费用与救助报酬：两个常被混淆的补偿通道","id":"施救费用与救助报酬-两个常被混淆的补偿通道"},{"level":2,"text":"把三层对象建进定损系统","id":"把三层对象建进定损系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"批单变更与保单数据管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-cargo-insurance-claims/insured-value-policy/policy-endorsement-data-management"},"next":{"title":"检验查勘与货损定损方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-cargo-insurance-claims/risk-loss-assessment/survey-inspection-damage-assessment"}}